  "goodToKnow": "Die Sonderstellung is a special position or status: eine Sonderstellung einnehmen, genießen. Bavaria, with its own party CSU in a permanent alliance with the CDU, is often said to have a Sonderstellung. Sonder- means special: das Sonderangebot (special offer), der Sonderfall. Historians debate the German Sonderweg, the idea of a uniquely German path to modernity. Plural: die Sonderstellungen."
